      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name} Ah ok so it was a misunderstanding on my part of what the option is supposed to do, probably compounded by being confused by the other bug you mentioned when trying it myself. The documentation helped explain it a lot, I wasn't aware of where to find beta docs. You can close this and I'll consider this other canny as the feature request that would cover the use case I was imagining https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/add-vrc-constraints-to-implement-local-axis-constrains-and-transformation-constr",
